'''Ginger''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2015 Christmas Knife Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is silver with a strip of gingerbread along the spine with frosting and red and green candy pieces on it. The guard and handle are made out of gingerbread, but on the handle is white and green frosting strips with blue, green, red, and magenta candy pieces on it.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Ginger Gun (2015)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Ginger_Set_(Rare) Ginger Set].

